SSL cert expired on a site and are unable to access it (Common issue with SHB)
On your keyboard type (not in anyfield) thisisunsafe
For a permanent change:
open regedit
go to:
HKEY Local Machine\Polices\Microsoft\Edge
look for the key:
SSLErrorOverrideAllowed
change value to 1
close and reopen Edge and try the site again the option
